#{ "file": "mcp-servers/plc-mcp-bridge/tools_tags.py", "findings": [ #{ "severity": "MEDIUM", "issue": "add_tag/delete_tag/create_tag_table/delete_tag_table 等变更命令无任何审计写入，与 tools_blocks.py 的 fail-closed 审计闸门不一致；delete_tag_table 标注 destructiveHint=True 却仅靠 dry_run 保护，无 confirm 与审计，审计链可被绕过", "evidence": "mcp-servers/plc-mcp-bridge/tools_tags.py L96 annotations={'destructiveHint': True}；L97-98 delete_tag_table 仅参数 tag_table_name, dry_run=False；L107-109 dry_run 检查后直接 _run_tiaworker('delete-tag-table', params)；L69/L72、L88-90、L193-194 各命令均无 audit。对照 tools_blocks.py L17-28 _audit_gate fail-closed、L97/148" }, #{ "severity": "MEDIUM", "issue": "async def 工具内直接调用阻塞式 _run_tiaworker（subprocess.run，超时最长 300s），未像 tools_blocks.py 用 asyncio.to_thread 包裹；单次慢调用冻结整个事件循环，并发 MCP 请求全部被阻塞（同问题存在于 tools_project/tools_types/tools_pipeline/tools_export/tools_diagnostics/tools_hardware/tools_plcsim 及 _helpers.plc_apply）", "evidence": "tools_tags.py L6-9: async def list_tag_tables 内直接 `result = _run_tiaworker(\"list-tags\", ...)`（其余 L28/71/90/108/122/140/164/193 同款，均无 await/to_thread）；对比 tools_blocks.py L12-14: `async def _run_tiaworker_async(...): return await asyncio.to_thread(_run_tiaworker, command, data, timeout=timeout)`；_help" } ] },
#{ "file": "mcp-servers/plc-gateway/workflows/guarded_apply.py", "findings": [ #{ "severity": "MEDIUM", "issue": "validate_guarded_apply 不校验 network_index 存在性与类型，preview(第266行)/execute(第372/443行) 均以 op.get(\"network_index\", 0) 默认 0 静默定位网络 0；且对非 dict 操作直接 op.get 抛 AttributeError（无 isinstance 防护，对比 network_patch._validate_operation 第141行），畸形输入导致未捕获异常而非校验错误", "evidence": "guarded_apply.py:157-192 validate_guarded_apply 无 network_index 检查；:184 op.get(\"operation\",\"\") 无 isinstance 守卫；:264-266 preview 中 net_idx = op.get(\"network_index\", 0) 且仅检查 net_idx >= len(networks)（负数与非整数均可越过）；:371-372、:439-440 execute 两处 op.get(\"network_index\", 0)；:377 net_idx < len(networks_before)" } ] },
#{ "file": "mcp-servers/plc-gateway/contracts/preview_apply.py", "findings": [ #{ "severity": "MEDIUM", "issue": "PreviewManager._tokens 与 consume_token/validate_token 无任何锁，token.used 的读-改-写非原子，并发调用同一确认令牌时两个执行体可同时读到 used=False 并都放行，一次性消费/防重放保证存在 TOCTOU 竞态", "evidence": "preview_apply.py L304: self._tokens: dict[str, PreviewToken] = {}（无锁普通 dict）；L369: if token.used:（读）；L405: token.used = True（写），两者被 validate_token 内的 expired 检查、HMAC verify、self._audit.record(磁盘 open/write)分隔；L396-407 consume_token = validate_token(...) 后置 used=True。全文件 grep 'lock|thread|async|await" } ] },
