#{ "file": "ai-plc-assistant/backend/search/indexer.py", "findings": [ #{ "severity": "MEDIUM", "issue": "同一 sqlite3 连接（check_same_thread=False）被事件循环查询与多个 asyncio.to_thread 索引 worker 并发使用，_insert_entry 中 entries 与 entries_fts 两条 INSERT 之间可能插入其他线程的语句，last_insert_rowid() 会把 FTS 行错误关联到其他线程的 rowid，并发导入/索引会损坏索引；clear() 的 delete-all 也与在途插入存在竞争", "evidence": "indexer.py:29 'sqlite3.connect(self.db_path, check_same_thread=False)'; indexer.py:21 仅有 _init_lock；indexer.py:117-137 两次 self.conn.execute，第二条 'VALUES (last_insert_rowid(), ?, ?, ?)'；indexer.py:287-291 clear() 先 delete-all 再 DELETE FROM entries 后 commit；main.py:41 'search_engine = SearchIndex(db_pa" } ] },
